<html>
 <head>
  <title></title>
 </head>
 <body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
              border-collapse:collapse;
              background-color:#ffffff;" width="100%">
   <tbody>
    <tr>
     <td align="center" style="padding:0;">
      <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:760px;
                              width:100%;
                              background-color:#ffffff;
                              border:2px solid #c9a75d;
                              border-collapse:collapse;" width="100%">
       <tbody>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding:0;"><img alt="Arelia Email Banner Image" src="{[devName:Arelia_Email_Banner_Image]}" style="display:block;
                                           width:100%;
                                           max-width:100%;
                                           height:auto;
                                           border:0;" title="Arelia Email Banner Image" /></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding:30px 34px 32px 34px;"><p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Dear <strong>{{{Case.Supervisor_Name__c}}}</strong>,</p> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">We would like to inform you that a new support case has been successfully registered in the system for your assigned project Which requires your review and attention :</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
                                              border-collapse:collapse;
                                              margin-bottom:20px;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="border-top:1px solid #e3d2a8;
                                                       padding-top:20px;"><p style="margin:0;
                                                          font-size:20px;
                                                          line-height:1.4;
                                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                          color:#1f1f1f;"><strong>Project Details:</strong></p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
                                              border-collapse:collapse;
                                              margin-bottom:24px;
                                              background-color:#faf8f3;
                                              border-left:3px solid #c9a75d;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="padding:16px 10px 10px 18px;
                                                       width:250px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;"><strong>Project Name:</strong></td>
             <td style="padding:16px 18px 10px 15px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;"><strong>{{{Case.Project__c}}}</strong>,</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
             <td style="padding:0 10px 10px 18px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;"><strong>Project Client:</strong></td>
             <td style="padding:0 18px 10px 15px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;"><strong>{{{Case.Project_Client_Name__c}}}</strong>,</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
             <td style="padding:0 10px 16px 18px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;"><strong>Project Client Contact Email:</strong></td>
             <td style="padding:0 18px 16px 15px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;"><strong>{{{Case.Project_Client_Email__c}}}</strong></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">We kindly request you to evaluate the issue and initiate the necessary steps to ensure a timely resolution. Please find the Case Details provided below for your reference :</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
                                              border-collapse:collapse;
                                              margin-bottom:20px;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="border-top:1px solid #e3d2a8;
                                                       padding-top:20px;"><p style="margin:0;
                                                          font-size:20px;
                                                          line-height:1.4;
                                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                          color:#1f1f1f;"><strong>Case Details:</strong></p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
                                              border-collapse:collapse;
                                              margin-bottom:26px;
                                              background-color:#faf8f3;
                                              border-left:3px solid #c9a75d;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="padding:16px 10px 10px 18px;
                                                       width:220px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;"><strong>Case Issue Type:</strong></td>
             <td style="padding:16px 18px 10px 15px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;"><strong>{{{Case.Type}}}</strong>,</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
             <td style="padding:0 10px 10px 18px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;"><strong>Case Priority:</strong></td>
             <td style="padding:0 18px 10px 15px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;"><strong>{{{Case.Priority}}}</strong>,</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
             <td style="padding:0 10px 10px 18px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;"><strong>Case Subject:</strong></td>
             <td style="padding:0 18px 10px 15px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;"><strong>{{{Case.Subject}}}</strong>,</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
             <td style="padding:0 10px 16px 18px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;"><strong>Case Description:</strong></td>
             <td style="padding:0 18px 16px 15px;
                                                       vertical-align:top;
                                                       font-size:18px;
                                                       line-height:1.5;
                                                       font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                       color:#222222;">{{{Case.Description}}}</td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">For any additional information required, please feel free to contact the client directly and keep the case updated with your progress.</p> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">We appreciate your cooperation and continued commitment to delivering a smooth and high-quality project experience.</p> <p style="margin:0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Best Regards,<br /> <strong>Arelia Team</strong></p></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
         <td align="center" style="background-color:#171717;
                                       border-top:2px solid #C99A3D;
                                       padding:24px 32px 22px 32px;
                                       text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 5px 0;
                                          font-size:24px;
                                          line-height:1.3;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#D6B36A;
                                          font-weight:bold;
                                          text-align:center;">Arelia</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:11px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                          color:#C99A3D;
                                          letter-spacing:2px;
                                          text-align:center;">PREMIUM &amp; LUXURY INTERIOR DESIGNS</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
                                              border-collapse:collapse;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td align="center" style="border-top:1px solid #6E5427;
                                                       padding-top:16px;
                                                       text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 5px 0;
                                                          font-size:11px;
                                                          line-height:1.6;
                                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                                          color:#8F887F;
                                                          text-align:center;">This email was sent because a new support case was registered for an Arelia project and requires supervisor attention.</p> <p style="margin:0;
                                                          font-size:11px;
                                                          line-height:1.6;
                                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                                          color:#8F887F;
                                                          text-align:center;">© 2026 Arelia. All rights reserved.</p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table></td>
        </tr>
       </tbody>
      </table></td>
    </tr>
   </tbody>
  </table>
 </body>
</html>